{"sha":"9783a49979c94c401ff8c0e51b2eefae7ea95ae3","node_id":"C_kwDOAAVlldoAKDk3ODNhNDk5NzljOTRjNDAxZmY4YzBlNTFiMmVlZmFlN2VhOTVhZTM","commit":{"author":{"name":"tanyongkiam","email":"tanyongkiam@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-26T13:56:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"Michael Norrish","email":"Michael.Norrish@anu.edu.au","date":"2026-10-26T22:48:32Z"},"message":"RecordType: name the variables of the record cases proof\n\nThe record package's cases proof stripped its goal and then split on\nthe variable the type's nchotomy quantifies.  When that variable's name\nis also a constant name, stripping renames it and the split no longer\napplies, so the record cannot be defined.  The proof now introduces the\nvariables it uses by name.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5","tree":{"sha":"29cad92945bc239c6389d991c6ae6b3ead1f6da3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HOL-Theorem-Prover/HOL/git/trees/29cad92945bc239c6389d991c6ae6b3ead1f6da3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HOL-Theorem-Prover/HOL/git/commits/9783a49979c94c401ff8c0e51b2eefae7ea95ae3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HOL-Theorem-Prover/HOL/commits/9783a49979c94c401ff8c0e51b2eefae7ea95ae3","html_url":"https://github.com/HOL-Theorem-Prover/HOL/commit/9783a49979c94c401ff8c0e51b2eefae7ea95ae3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HOL-Theorem-Prover/HOL/commits/9783a49979c94c401ff8c0e51b2eefae7ea95ae3/comments","author":{"login":"tanyongkiam","id":7911961,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTE5NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7911961?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanyongkiam","html_url":"https://github.com/tanyongkiam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanyongkiam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanyongkiam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanyongkiam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_ur